      <h2 id="hosted-cluster-etcd-restore-on-premise_hcp-backup-restore-on-premise" class="group scroll-mt-20">Restoring etcd on a hosted cluster<a href="#hosted-cluster-etcd-restore-on-premise_hcp-backup-restore-on-premise" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Fix failures by restoring a snapshot of etcd on a hosted cluster.</p>
