      <li>
      Scale down the etcd statefulset by entering the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc scale -n ${CONTROL_PLANE_NAMESPACE} statefulset/etcd --replicas=0"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
